&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Strong listening skills and the ability to understand complex technical problems and become a trusted resource for decision-makers across technology and finance organizations&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Excellent verbal, written, and presentation skills&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A positive attitude and strong work ethic, with the ability to operate in a highly ambiguous environment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
